icant deviations from the Chromium, such as branding, configuration formats, file locations, and other interface changes.\nungoogled-chromium will not modify the Chromium browser outside of the project's goals.\nSince these goals and requirements are not precise, unclear situations are discussed and decided on a case-by-case basis.","moniker":"ungoogled-chromium","name":"Chromium","packageUrl":"https://github.com/ungoogled-software/ungoogled-chromium-windows/releases","publisher":"The Chromium Authors","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/ungoogled-software/ungoogled-chromium-windows","tags":["browser","chromium","ungoogled"]}},"publisherUrl":"https://github.com/ungoogled-software/ungoogled-chromium-windows","releaseDate":"2022-08-04","releaseDateSource":"manifest","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"97d6aa2689f0a05f7847653a62b8624720d15b5d","manifestVersion":"1.6.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/e/eloston/ungoogled-chromium/133.0.6943.126/eloston.ungoogled-chromium.yaml","sha256":"9c15e0ceea1ac9c0e82607ae58d6cb2518d318a85b3196914879500a508b4dd3"},{"path":"manifests/e/eloston/ungoogled-chromium/133.0.6943.126/eloston.ungoogled-chromium.installer.yaml","sha256":"6fe4e44ed2e875a1d422bf875d046b591897824134d6bc3e32e34b7dbe6038b3"},{"path":"manifests/e/eloston/ungoogled-chromium/133.0.6943.126/eloston.ungoogled-chromium.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"5b50fadcd7562058116f2fac16f4cf6b4863a73bc6f45bb9b0abecdcf06ad174"}],"repository":"microsoft/winget-pkgs"},"version":"133.0.6943.126"}